## [Trustee Areas](https://www.santaclarausd.org/about-us/board-of-trustees#fs-panel-44266)

[](https://www.santaclarausd.org/about-us/board-of-trustees)

Santa Clara Unified School District's board members are determined through a "by-trustee area election." A by-trustee area election divides the district into geographic, equally populated areas. Each voter will have the opportunity to choose a representative that lives in the same area they reside in. Use the map below to view the trustee areas (the highlighted borders are approximate). Demographic information about the SCUSD community follows in a visual map at the bottom of this webpage.

## Trustee Area Election Sequencing

### November 2026

Trustee Area 1 | Board Member Jim Canova  
 Trustee Area 3 | Board Member Vickie Fairchild  
 Trustee Area 4 | Board Member Andrew Ratermann  
 Trustee Area 6 | Board Member Jodi Muirhead

### November 2028

Trustee Area 2 | Board Member Kathy Watanable  
 Trustee Area 5 | Board Member Michele Ryan, Ph.D.  
 Trustee Area 7 | Board Member Bonnie Lieberman

